ated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-01-29T03:16:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T18:16:19Z","closed_at":"2026-01-29T18:16:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested version: latest version (4.6) from git commit(5ad8b27d8db0776700c2b08bf68fbea5e0a4680d)\n\n\n### System information\n\nLinux-Godot4.6\n\n### Issue description\n\nError: \n```\ncore/object/script_language_extension.cpp: In static member function 'static void ScriptLanguageExtension::_bind_methods()':\n./core/object/object.h:386:87: error: '_gdvirtual__create_script_get_method_info' was not declared in this scope; did you mean '_gdvirtual__reload_scripts_get_method_info'?\n  386 | #define GDVIRTUAL_BIND(m_name, ...) ::ClassDB::add_virtual_method(get_class_static(), _gdvirtual_##m_name##_get_method_info(), true, sarray(__VA_ARGS__));\n      |                                                                                       ^~~~~~~~~~~\ncore/object/script_language_extension.cpp:107:9: note: in expansion of macro 'GDVIRTUAL_BIND'\n  107 |         GDVIRTUAL_BIND(_create_script);\n```\n\nReason:\nin source file, GDVIRTUAL_BIND(_create_script) is written in DISABLE_DEPRECATED block\nbut in header, GDVIRTUAL0RC(Object *, _create_script) is out of DISABLE_DEPRECATED block\n\nSolution:\nGDVIRTUAL0RC(Object *, _create_script) should go inside of DISABLE_DEPRECATED block like:\n```\n#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED\n\tGDVIRTUAL0RC(Object *, _create_script)\n\tGDVIRTUAL0RC(bool, _has_named_classes)\n#endif\n```\n\ninstead of  as current version\n```\nGDVIRTUAL0RC(Object *, _create_script)\n#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED\n\tGDVIRTUAL0RC(bool, _has_named_classes)\n#endif\n```\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nBuild command: scons target=editor deprecated=no \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIt is not about godot project but godot source tree itself","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115556/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115556/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}